- Runtime capable of HTTPS requests.
- If using `scripts/api.ts`: TypeScript toolchain (or transpile to JS).

## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (6)
- `GET /agrp/prod/{prodToken}` — Authenticate with product token.
- `GET /api/identity` — Retrieve user identity via API.
- `GET /config/com/{comToken}` — Authenticate with com token.
- `GET /identity/` — Retrieve user identity information.
- `GET /sid/json` — Get session ID in JSON format.
- `PATCH /session/data` — Update session data during authentication flow.

### Data Read (5)
- `GET /a/api/fastlane.json` — Get fastlane configuration.
- `GET /pagead/conversion/{conversionTimestamp}/` — Retrieve conversion data.
- `GET /ups/{upId}/fed` — Retrieve fed data.
- `GET /v2/advertiser` — Get advertiser information.
- `GET /WRSiteInterceptEngine/Asset.php` — Retrieve asset data.

### Data Write (10)
- `POST /.well-known/private-aggregation/report-shared-storage` — Report private aggregation data.
- `POST /{id}` — Update car details by ID.
- `POST /hits/pageviews` — Record page view hits.
- `POST /openrtb/pbjs` — Submit OpenRTB data.
- `POST /p/conversions/c/j` — Post conversion data.
- `POST /page/{pageId}/ad` — Post an ad to a specific page.
- `POST /PVMiEVegy/jlu/ZdvaDA/iY9zSLNSzSNcX2/W2poWkgCAw/aws5Xz/trBmMB` — Update car details (complex ID).
- `POST /ut/v3/prebid` — Submit prebid data.
- `POST /v1/batch` — Submit data in batch.
- `POST /WRSiteInterceptEngine/{WRSiteInterceptEngineId}` — Submit data to WRSiteInterceptEngine.

### Config (1)
- `GET /getconfig/sodar` — Fetch configuration settings.

### Core API (1)
- `GET /` — Retrieve a list of cars.

